        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 15A Royal Elegant Entry Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nLarge 2\" diameter very decorative entry <a href=\"/collections/first-impressions-door-pulls\">Door Pull from First Impressions</a>. Everyone who visits will wonder were you got these incredible pulls, they are very dramatic, and unforgettable.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 15A Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Length: 28\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 10\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 12</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 8 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged standard for  Surface Mounting with #10 x 1-1/2\" screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
